/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 617.0 Tm (The Certificate Management System is a full-stack web application for registering) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 604.0 Tm (On-Duty \(OD\) participation, collecting student certificates, identifying missing) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 591.0 Tm (submissions, and generating monthly reports. It replaces fragmented spreadsheet and) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 578.0 Tm (file-sharing workflows with a role-aware application backed by PostgreSQL.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 565.0 Tm () Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 552.0 Tm (The system has four application roles:) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 539.0 Tm () Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 526.0 Tm (- Student: views personal details and OD records, submits certificates, and downloads) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 513.0 Tm (submitted certificates.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 500.0 Tm (- Student Representative: searches students and registers OD records for events.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 487.0 Tm (- Coordinating Faculty: reviews OD records, identifies missing certificates, and) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 474.0 Tm (generates reports.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 461.0 Tm (- Administrator: provisions and manages the role hierarchy through administrative APIs.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 448.0 Tm () Tj
