/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 392.0 Tm (1. Provide a central record for OD registrations.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 379.0 Tm (2. Generate unique OD registration numbers safely under concurrent use.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 366.0 Tm (3. Allow students to submit certificates against their own OD records.) Tj
