/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 340.0 Tm (5. Provide faculty with monthly summaries, Excel exports, and certificate ZIP downloads.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 327.0 Tm (6. Store certificate files in a predictable, protected filesystem structure.) Tj
